</table>
</figure>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The inference hyper-parameters are listed in Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ B.1 Experiment Setup ‣ Appendix B Experiment Details ‣ M3T2IBench: A Large-Scale Multi-Category, Multi-Instance, Multi-Relation Text-to-Image Benchmark" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> is the total denoising steps and <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math> has the same meaning as in Equation <a href="#S4.E4" title="Equation 4 ‣ 4.1 Preliminaries ‣ 4 Method: Revise-Then-Enforce ‣ M3T2IBench: A Large-Scale Multi-Category, Multi-Instance, Multi-Relation Text-to-Image Benchmark" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> (except for Stable-Diffusion-3.5-Large-Turbo and FLUX.1-dev). These hyper-parameters are selected as their default settings.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">All experiments are conducted on Nvidia A40 GPU. Inferencing our whole benchmark generally takes <math id="A2.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>6</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">6</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A2.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10</annotation></semantics></math> GPU hours. Evaluating the generation result on our whole benchmark generally takes <math id="A2.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> GPU hour.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Details of our inference hyper-parameter.</figcaption>
<table id="A2.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">Model Name</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;"><math id="A2.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;"><math id="A2.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">Stable-Diffusion-3</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">28</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">7.0</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">Stable-Diffusion-3.5-Medium</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">28</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">7.0</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T5.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">Stable-Diffusion-3.5-Large-Turbo</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">4</td>
<td id="A2.T5.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:3.4pt;">-</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T5.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
